 "finding": "Native u8-aux consumer binds uchar scale/bias and decodes them in-register (log-scale exp + linear bias). It does not expand the compact aux back to f16. Inner-loop tax: incumbent 1.3333 decode-FMA/weight-byte at 6 B/iter; native 2.5 at 4 B/iter (4.5 FMA/byte vs 2.6667 before). executable_economics bytes-only: -0.0000 ms saved (the screen's +1.554 ms). With aux-decode FMA billed: -1.9426 ms (flop_ms 1.9426, byte_ms 0.0000). GPU A/B layer 3: incumbent 334.5682 GB/s in 249.75 us, native 269.7453 GB/s in 278.791 us, delta 29.041 us / -8355840 bytes. Token projection 1.858624 ms (PROJECTION_ARITHMETIC_OVER_PROBE).",
